    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Marital love is not just passion and thrill, but also shared memory of adversity.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7af67c1ba6a6d033380faa0c1a27592a013ef37d73d480ff52abba2895a45479",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "d9ee1fbae84ef63d9fd2f3832be0c6c241968d43c53f5ba52bd8aae1a46d8d21",
      "passageSha256": "1322eb8fffcea9b47a9a3ff6f240df48e0ff8e99ab61ece00c1e4752ddd2b0b1",
      "pdfPages": [
        151,
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Couples who have children can bond over parenthood and learn something new from raising them.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0e2513ce9f5b228be33e1d9ce41aa184d89ee6b98bdce9a00268dd9e77678016",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "d9ee1fbae84ef63d9fd2f3832be0c6c241968d43c53f5ba52bd8aae1a46d8d21",
      "passageSha256": "1322eb8fffcea9b47a9a3ff6f240df48e0ff8e99ab61ece00c1e4752ddd2b0b1",
      "pdfPages": [
        151,
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-s005",
      "sentenceText": "As B says, “The whole of life is lived again in the children; only then does one come to some understanding of one’s own life.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "56c80892b431b0000ebc05cbe6a3070e61455be170e81e455dc3fc3dc7248be9",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "0ecffe0c0cbfc5946544d9b9c1dab9d6af3ed0df38f4bc9f2f832995f0e1b031",
      "passageSha256": "e1ae489a9b6f2cf1b9ea3804f34c74adcb3d03d0c0f717eda2f9256ffd1eb820",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0086",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-s007",
      "sentenceText": "When they go to high school, you will reexperience being in high school, noticing both similarities and differences.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a78b38cde7f015d5555447c8216b0f849cc311471e7d020f17bfcf618b9978a6",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "0ecffe0c0cbfc5946544d9b9c1dab9d6af3ed0df38f4bc9f2f832995f0e1b031",
      "passageSha256": "e1ae489a9b6f2cf1b9ea3804f34c74adcb3d03d0c0f717eda2f9256ffd1eb820",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0087",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-s008",
      "sentenceText": "B uses poetic reproduction of music as a metaphor for marital love: “In music an even tempo may have much beauty and great effect”—even if it is monotonic.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c3dbdba9099a932ec20bf1689546965229367212d73027e359749a9f1734aece",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p151-06405-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "0ecffe0c0cbfc5946544d9b9c1dab9d6af3ed0df38f4bc9f2f832995f0e1b031",
      "passageSha256": "e1ae489a9b6f2cf1b9ea3804f34c74adcb3d03d0c0f717eda2f9256ffd1eb820",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0088",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Marital monotony can be beautiful, as Kierkegaard’s B suggests.",
      "sentenceSha256": "44962c37752121c74d12a03ebc4f3abd3ee93e437b43b085cd26114bfddb0d4d",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "98ef2f57cc90af343c52f0dddf13e4c6681d6836e2511860e9ba7a0ba0465f01",
      "passageSha256": "648205547831301fdf087385ef1d48577474e6ecb3157b7eadf647f16e1685f6",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0089",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "But for most, like Kierkegaard’s A, it can also be boring.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f85c7fc6c46b0b733276245c9e6c3360d0ec8ccc6c520fcd56656738255ada91",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "98ef2f57cc90af343c52f0dddf13e4c6681d6836e2511860e9ba7a0ba0465f01",
      "passageSha256": "648205547831301fdf087385ef1d48577474e6ecb3157b7eadf647f16e1685f6",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0090",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-s005",
      "sentenceText": "In the experiment, dating and married couples were randomly assigned into one of two conditions.",
      "sentenceSha256": "54ffdc17025d470eb88eaf2a02d891081ec8db997cf80ae4933609072e8ed5ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p152-03600-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "a494fee88ac47f90ccead121c90662a1171fb069c59975e89faf9253eafd7692",
      "passageSha256": "738b37a2def166ea9c3904a7eacdc306891e29b2ce714b6bcdac19737381b63c",
      "pdfPages": [
        152
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0091",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p152-06135-s001",
      "sentenceText": "As Aron predicted, couples completing the novel-arousing task reported significantly higher levels of relationship quality than those completing the mundane task after the activity.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c010cfbd35246963d5f4ea9b876251858f10f29413dec1f055d4a3fd20adc940",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p152-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "5f2b297281f3ab6b117363949f0eaf6746e0d250127eadd60b67b2a5dbd81325",
      "passageSha256": "626796552c4516cbc2c62aae8ac5f8ecafe3258cfb3be20673f2a7bbe91a94d5",
      "pdfPages": [
        152,
        153
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0092",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p152-06135-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The researchers then replicated these findings with a new sample of sixty-three married couples.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ea9e7195a97dbe8b5c57e0f7939ac65aca9cfbea56a1346a168a1e43f9d9e423",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p152-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "5f2b297281f3ab6b117363949f0eaf6746e0d250127eadd60b67b2a5dbd81325",
      "passageSha256": "626796552c4516cbc2c62aae8ac5f8ecafe3258cfb3be20673f2a7bbe91a94d5",
      "pdfPages": [
        152,
        153
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0093",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Aron and colleagues found that engaging in novel and challenging activities could rekindle love, and even passion.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f4ad0bfc2dbf35407d128b55382c1295bf2c2f3672dadb120b0d1925ecabf66d",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "a57b02228bcf6cab3f5d21f1784ca4dacc96d8b0a72d534f893cc3d93c01da9f",
      "passageSha256": "698d1cc971c38ba49ff1b5c2141b72b945ef43ec6b3a7cd6bb68b93ea5003a00",
      "pdfPages": [
        153
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0094",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-s003",
      "sentenceText": "It turns out that it is possible to keep love alive over many years.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e3ef513496f66f2f3c49f0d77954d756c8dfc93f72de02148ecef0bf793674e6",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "a57b02228bcf6cab3f5d21f1784ca4dacc96d8b0a72d534f893cc3d93c01da9f",
      "passageSha256": "698d1cc971c38ba49ff1b5c2141b72b945ef43ec6b3a7cd6bb68b93ea5003a00",
      "pdfPages": [
        153
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0095",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-s004",
      "sentenceText": "In another study, the researchers used a neuroimaging technique, showing participants facial images of their partner as well as images of a close friend and a stranger.",
      "sentenceSha256": "723e9424bc9db9952bd2d14306000fffa38d579682d843522acf69f62f489693",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p153-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "a57b02228bcf6cab3f5d21f1784ca4dacc96d8b0a72d534f893cc3d93c01da9f",
      "passageSha256": "698d1cc971c38ba49ff1b5c2141b72b945ef43ec6b3a7cd6bb68b93ea5003a00",
      "pdfPages": [
        153
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0096",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s04-p153-03675-s004",
      "sentenceText": "In this way, couples can experience “continuous rejuvenation.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "fee7d462de374397a0b84799d9a050bfc1bf090c6b91c7d54b421c0fe225ab43",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s04-p153-03675-r003-004",
